(text "E05 - 2Vrms SINGLE-ENDED, zero-DC post-receiver input. Not the codec differential pins. Supplies regulated and supervised externally." (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid d46a2826-4d57-513d-b475-08e386e217a0))
